{
  "method_ids": [
    "ct",
    "glm"
  ],
  "id": "ct-glm-smooth-convergence",
  "title": {
    "ja": "CT・GLM：移動する磁気静力学平衡の格子・時間収束",
    "en": "CT and GLM: mesh/time convergence of a moving magnetostatic equilibrium"
  },
  "summary": {
    "ja": "非零の磁気力と圧力勾配が釣り合う構成厳密解を使い、同じ初期セル状態・流束の速度上界・刻み列でCT/GLMを比較します。",
    "en": "Use a constructed exact equilibrium with nonzero magnetic force balanced by a pressure gradient, matching CT/GLM initial cell states, flux speed bound and time-step sequence."
  },
  "assumptions": {
    "ja": "周期単位正方形、γ=5/3、μ₀=1、平面MHD。A=.05[cos2π(x−.3t)+cos2π(y−.2t)]、B=(Ay,−Ax)、ρ=1、v=(.3,.2)、p=.1+(2π)²A²/2、t=.1。保存変数の解析的セル平均を比較します。公刊の標準問題名を借りない構成検証例です。",
    "en": "Periodic unit square, gamma5/3, mu0=1, planar MHD. A=.05[cos2pi(x−.3t)+cos2pi(y−.2t)], B=(Ay,−Ax), rho1, v=(.3,.2), p=.1+(2pi)²A²/2 at t=.1. Compare analytic conserved cell averages. This is a constructed verification case, not a claimed published standard benchmark."
  },
  "algorithm": {
    "ja": "両法とも区分定数・同じ固定Rusanov速度α=3・前進Eulerです。CTは面Bと共有算術corner EMF、GLMはcell B/ψとch=3・物理減衰率κ=2を使用。全格子で同じ384刻み、両法のdt列も同一です。CT面平均から復元した初期cell BとGLM初期Bが一致します。",
    "en": "Both use piecewise constants, the same fixed Rusanov speed alpha3 and forward Euler. CT uses face B/shared arithmetic corner EMFs; GLM uses cell B/psi with fixed ch3 and physical damping rate kappa2. All meshes use384 steps and identical CT/GLM dt sequences; initial reconstructed CT cell B matches GLM cell B."
  },
  "validation": {
    "ja": "16²/32²/64²の保存変数L1/L2/L∞誤差と観測次数を測ります。最細格子の刻み倍増差を空間誤差の.1以下と比較。時間収束は固定8²で16/32/64/128刻みを、許容誤差・最大刻みを二重に細分したDOP853へ照合します。質量・E、正値性、native CT divと共通cell div、ψも記録します。",
    "en": "Measure conserved-variable L1/L2/Linf errors and observed orders at16²/32²/64². Compare finest-grid step doubling with.1 of the spatial error. At fixed8², compare16/32/64/128 steps with doubly refined DOP853 tolerances/max steps. Record mass/E, positivity, native CT divergence, common cell divergence and psi."
  },
  "limits": {
    "ja": "定数LLF粘性・周期中心演算子では、GLMのdiv=ψ=0部分空間は丸めまで保たれます。本例は結合MHDの精度を調べ、能動的cleaningは別の非物理診断対照で調べます。p(q平均)はpの厳密平均と同一ではありません。DOP853は時間だけ独立で空間RHSは共有します。刻み倍増差は経験的汚染目安で厳密誤差上界ではなく、CT/GLMの内部表現差を含む有限離散化全体の比較です。",
    "en": "With constant LLF viscosity and periodic centered operators, the GLM div=psi=0 subspace remains invariant up to roundoff. This tests coupled-MHD accuracy; a separate nonphysical control activates cleaning. p(q-average) is not the exact averaged p. DOP853 is independent in time only and shares the spatial RHS. Step differences are empirical contamination indicators, not rigorous bounds; face/cell representation differences remain part of the comparison."
  },
  "references": [
    {
      "id": "dedner2002",
      "author": "A. Dedner et al.",
      "year": 2002,
      "title": "Hyperbolic Divergence Cleaning for the MHD Equations",
      "doi": "10.1006/jcph.2001.6961",
      "url": "https://www.tp4.ruhr-uni-bochum.de/~sw/papers/JCP2002.6961.pdf",
      "review_level": "author-hosted primary paper; selected original equations 17–19 and 24, pp.650–651",
      "review": {
        "ja": "通常のGLMのB/ψ式と減衰、エネルギー保存、追加のEGLM項との区別を原著の選択式で確認しました。全文監査ではありません。",
        "en": "Checked selected original GLM B/psi and damping equations, conserved physical energy, and the distinction from extra EGLM source terms; not a full-paper audit."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "gardiner-stone2005",
      "author": "T. A. Gardiner and J. M. Stone",
      "year": 2005,
      "title": "An unsplit Godunov method for ideal MHD via constrained transport",
      "doi": "10.1016/j.jcp.2004.11.016",
      "url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/astro-ph/0501557",
      "review_level": "author preprint; selected section2.2/equations13–20",
      "review": {
        "ja": "面平均Bと共有corner EMFの構造を確認しました。今回の算術flux-CTを、論文のupwind CT・CTU実装そのものとは呼びません。",
        "en": "Checked the face-average/shared-corner-EMF structure. The present arithmetic flux-CT is not identified with the paper’s upwind CT/CTU algorithm."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "toth2000-divb",
      "author": "G. Tóth",
      "year": 2000,
      "title": "The ∇·B=0 Constraint in Shock-Capturing Magnetohydrodynamics Codes",
      "doi": "10.1006/jcph.2000.6519",
      "url": "https://doi.org/10.1006/jcph.2000.6519",
      "review_level": "author paper abstract and bibliographic metadata",
      "review": {
        "ja": "div B制約手法の比較という原著の主題と書誌を確認しました。今回の数値判定や新しい構成例の出典とはしません。",
        "en": "Confirmed the original comparison topic and bibliographic identity; not a source of this experiment’s criteria or constructed equilibrium."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "scipy-dop853-official",
      "author": "SciPy developers",
      "year": 2024,
      "title": "scipy.integrate.solve_ivp: DOP853",
      "url": "https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy-1.14.1/reference/generated/scipy.integrate.solve_ivp.html",
      "review_level": "official versioned API and actual independent time-integrator execution",
      "review": {
        "ja": "DOP853を別の時間積分器として実行します。空間RHSを共有するため、独立した空間離散化とは呼びません。",
        "en": "Execute DOP853 as a separate time integrator; shared spatial RHS means it is not an independent spatial discretization."
      }
    }
  ],
  "equations": [
    "A=a[\\cos k(x-ut)+\\cos k(y-vt)],\\quad\\mathbf B=(A_y,-A_x),\\quad J_z=-\\Delta A=k^2A",
    "p=p_0+\\tfrac12k^2A^2,\\qquad\\nabla p=J_z\\nabla A=\\mathbf J\\times\\mathbf B",
    "\\bar{\\mathbf U}_{ij}=\\frac1{\\Delta x\\Delta y}\\int_{K_{ij}}\\mathbf U\\,dx\\,dy,\\qquad p(\\bar{\\mathbf U})\\ne\\bar p",
    "\\mathbf U^{m+1}=\\mathbf U^m+\\Delta t\\,L_h(\\mathbf U^m),\\qquad C_{\\rm sum}=\\alpha\\Delta t(\\Delta x^{-1}+\\Delta y^{-1})"
  ],
